BT 1 0 0 1 0 62.5 Tm /F1 10 Tf 14.5 TL .062308 Tw (KittyPatcher is a Python-based patcher for the Twine/SugarCube game Course of Temptation \(COT\). It) Tj T* 0 Tw 1.475 Tw (reads .mod files from a mods/ folder and applies their directives to the game HTML before launch.) Tj T* 0 Tw 1.94 Tw (v0.7.0 added a dependency graph load-order system, two new guard clauses \(IfPassageContains,) Tj T* 0 Tw .483333 Tw (IfPassageHasTag\), a new Hook around: timing variant, TOML configuration, patch result caching, and) Tj T* 0 Tw (a more reliable HTML processing layer via BeautifulSoup 4.) Tj T* ET
Q
