BT 1 0 0 1 0 62.5 Tm /F1 10 Tf 14.5 TL .208235 Tw (v0.7.4 adds: a content-addressed SHA-256 patch cache \(startup time ~4 min to ~0.2 s on cache hit\); a) Tj T* 0 Tw 1.918333 Tw (batch pre-pass for Append To Passage and Insert After/Before that eliminates repeated full-HTML) Tj T* 0 Tw 1.69 Tw (scans; a two-pass anchor search so Replace: works on JS script-block targets \(setup.storyhints.db) Tj T* 0 Tw 2.437857 Tw (entries etc.\); and auto-close after browser launch. Three bugs fixed: cache not saved on failure,) Tj T* 0 Tw (duplicate Hook conflict handling, and cache key including log files.) Tj T* ET
