BT 1 0 0 1 0 48 Tm /F1 10 Tf 14.5 TL .081765 Tw (How it works: each .mod file contains one or more directives. KittyPatcher loads every .mod file it finds,) Tj T* 0 Tw 9.33 Tw (applies all directives in a fixed seven-phase order, writes the patched game to) Tj T* 0 Tw 1.271667 Tw (CourseOfTemptation.patched.html, and opens the game in the browser. The original HTML is never) Tj T* 0 Tw (modified -- a backup is taken on first run and restored at the start of every subsequent run.) Tj T* ET
